## CLI Reference

### `{{ command:name }}`

```bash
php artisan {{ command:name }} [target] [options]
```

#### Arguments
- `target`: Path or identifier (default: current directory).

#### Options
| Option | Shortcut | Type | Default | Description |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| `--dry-run` | `-d` | bool | `false` | Run without writing changes |
| `--json` | | bool | `false` | Output machine-readable JSON |

